@baseUrl = https://localhost:44312

### Preview a real DOCX file (copy the antiforgery token from the signed-in page)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/toeic-exams/import-preview
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ToeicDocxBoundary

--ToeicDocxBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="__RequestVerificationToken"

{{antiforgeryToken}}
--ToeicDocxBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="your-real-exam.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./your-real-exam.docx
--ToeicDocxBoundary--

### Save the reviewed preview as a draft (use the actual response from the preview and a fresh antiforgery token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/toeic-exams
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{antiforgeryToken}}

{
  "title": "{{reviewedTitle}}",
  "code": "{{uniqueExamCode}}",
  "durationMinutes": 75,
  "sourceFileName": "{{sourceFileName}}",
  "questions": [
    {
      "part": 5,
      "number": 1,
      "questionText": "{{reviewedQuestionText}}",
      "passage": null,
      "optionA": "{{reviewedOptionA}}",
      "optionB": "{{reviewedOptionB}}",
      "optionC": "{{reviewedOptionC}}",
      "optionD": "{{reviewedOptionD}}",
      "correctAnswer": null
    }
  ]
}

### Read saved draft metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/toeic-exams/{{savedExamId}}
Accept: application/json
